      "settings": {
        "main_title": "Pressure-Treated Wood vs. Composite Decking",
        "subtitle": "The best deck material depends on your budget, preferred appearance and maintenance expectations.",
        "description": "New York decks may experience rain, snow, ice, humidity, summer heat, freeze-and-thaw cycles and coastal moisture. Neither pressure-treated wood nor composite is automatically best for every property.",
