        "card_1_features": "Generally lower\nNatural wood grain and variation\nMay require cleaning, staining or sealing\nMay develop over time\nMay check, crack or change color\nCan be stained or refinished\nDepends on stain, color and exposure\nBoards can often be replaced or refinished\nLower initial cost and natural appearance\nSubject to material and A-DIY terms",
